@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Third";
    var userId = TempData["UserId"]?.ToString();
}

<h1>Third</h1>
User Id : @userId
<p>TempData Value is available in Third Action or View depending on the access pattern in second</p>
<p>if accessed as var userId = TempData["UserId"]?.ToString(); then not available</p>
<p>if accessed as var userId = TempData["UserId"]?.ToString(); with TempData.Keep(); then available</p>
<p>if accessed as var userId = TempData.Peek("UserId")?.ToString(); then available</p>
<a class="btn btn-success" asp-controller="TempData" asp-action="First">Go First</a>
